return ['domain'=>'zinn-campaigns','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-campaigns','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-13T22:50:58+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-13T22:50:58+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Campaigns – Email & SMS Marketing for WooCommerce & More'=>'Zinn® Campaigns – Email & SMS Marketing for WooCommerce & More','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-campaigns'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-campaigns','Connect your WordPress site or WooCommerce store to Zinn® Campaigns in one click and grow your list with double opt-in sign-up forms. Email, SMS and WhatsApp campaigns are sent from your Zinn® Campaigns account.'=>'Unganisha tovuti yako ya WordPress au duka la WooCommerce kwenye Zinn® Campaigns kwa mbofyo mmoja na ukue orodha yako kwa fomu za kujisajili za uthibitishaji mara mbili. Kampeni za barua pepe, SMS na WhatsApp zinatumwa kutoka kwa akaunti yako ya Zinn® Campaigns.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','You are not allowed to manage Zinn® Campaigns on this site.'=>'Huruhusiwi kudhibiti Zinn® Campaigns kwenye tovuti hii.','This site is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Tovuti hii imeunganishwa kwenye Zinn® Campaigns.','This site is disconnected. Sign-up forms stop sending new sign-ups to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Tovuti hii imetenganishwa. Fomu za kujisajili huacha kutuma usajili mpya kwa Zinn® Campaigns.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Muunganisho huo ulichukua muda mrefu sana au ulianzishwa katika kivinjari kingine. Bonyeza Unganisha tena.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® haikukubali muunganisho. Bonyeza Unganisha tena; ikiwa itaendelea kushindwa, wasiliana na usaidizi wa Zinn®.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Tovuti yako haikuweza kufikia Zinn®. Hakikisha kuwa seva pangishi yako inaruhusu miunganisho inayotoka nje, kisha ubonyeze «Unganisha tena».','The %s add-on'=>'Kijalizo cha %s','You get Pro free with any paid Zinn® Campaigns plan: there is no separate licence to buy. Pro is a separate add-on plugin you download from your Zinn® dashboard.'=>'Unapata Pro bila malipo kwa mpango wowote unaolipishwa wa Zinn® Campaigns: hakuna leseni tofauti ya kununua. Pro ni programu-jalizi tofauti ya nyongeza unayopakua kutoka kwa dashibodi yako ya Zinn®.','Included: your account has a paid Zinn® Campaigns plan.'=>'Imejumuishwa: akaunti yako ina mpango uliolipwa wa Zinn® Campaigns.','Free trial until %s. Pick any paid Zinn® Campaigns plan to keep Pro after that.'=>'Jaribio la bila malipo hadi %s. Chagua mpango wowote wa kulipia wa Zinn® Campaigns ili uendelee kutumia Pro baada ya hapo.','Not included right now: the free trial has ended or the plan is not paid. Your Pro settings are kept and come back the moment a paid plan is live.'=>'Haijajumuishwa hivi sasa: jaribio la bila malipo limekwisha au mpango haujalipiwa. Mipangilio yako ya Pro imehifadhiwa na itarudi mara tu mpango unaolipiwa utakapofanya kazi.','Connect this site to see what your plan includes.'=>'Unganisha tovuti hii ili kuona kile ambacho mpango wako unajumuisha.','Download the Pro add-on'=>'Pakua kiboreshaji cha Pro','See Zinn® Campaigns plans'=>'Tazama vifurushi vya Zinn® Campaigns','Sign-up forms'=>'Fomu za kujisajili','Add the "Zinn® Campaigns sign-up form" block to any page or post, or paste a shortcode below. Every sign-up gets a confirmation e-mail first (double opt-in), and only people who confirm join your list.'=>'Ongeza kizuizi cha "Fomu ya kujisajili ya Zinn® Campaigns" kwenye ukurasa au chapisho lolote, au bandika msimbo mfupi hapa chini. Kila anayejisajili hupokea barua pepe ya uthibitisho kwanza (idhini maradufu), na ni watu wanaothibitisha pekee wanaojiunga na orodha yako.','Your account has no sign-up forms yet. Create one in your Zinn® dashboard under Campaigns, Forms, then press Refresh.'=>'Akaunti yako haina fomu zozote za kujisajili bado. Fungua moja katika dashibodi yako ya Zinn® chini ya Kampeni, Fomu, kisha ubonyeze Onyesha upya.','Form'=>'Fomu','List'=>'Orodha','Shortcode'=>'Msimbo mfupi','Grow your list on this site with double opt-in sign-up forms, and send email, SMS and WhatsApp campaigns from your Zinn® Campaigns account.'=>'Kuza orodha yako kwenye tovuti hii kwa fomu za kujisajili za uthibitishaji mara mbili, na utume kampeni za barua pepe, SMS na WhatsApp kutoka kwa akaunti yako ya Zinn® Campaigns.','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this site, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'"Unganisha" hufungua Zinn® katika dirisha hili. Ingia au uunde akaunti, idhinisha tovuti hii, kisha utarudi hapa moja kwa moja. Hutawahi kubandika ufunguo.','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Unganisha kwenye Zinn® Campaigns','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini Zinn® haikuweza kufikiwa sasa hivi. Tutajaribu tena hivi karibuni.','Site'=>'Tovuti','Connected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Open for your account'=>'Wazi kwa akaunti yako','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'Bado haijafunguliwa kwa akaunti yako. Zinn® itakutumia barua pepe itakapokuwa tayari.','Refresh'=>'Onyesha upya','Disconnect'=>'Tenganisha','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuunganisha tovuti hii.','You are not allowed to disconnect this site.'=>'Huruhusiwi kukata muunganisho wa tovuti hii.','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn® Campaigns sign-up form'=>'Fomu ya kujisajili ya Zinn® Campaigns','Choose a form'=>'Chagua fomu','A double opt-in sign-up form from your Zinn® Campaigns account.'=>'Fomu ya kujisajili ya uthibitisho mara mbili kutoka kwa akaunti yako ya Zinn® Campaigns.','Sign-up form'=>'Fomu ya kujisajili','Zinn® Campaigns: connect this site and choose one of your forms to show a sign-up form here.'=>'Zinn® Campaigns: unganisha tovuti hii na uchague mojawapo ya fomu zako ili kuonyesha fomu ya kujisajili hapa.','Sign up'=>'Jisajili','Thank you. Check your inbox and click the link in our e-mail to confirm.'=>'Asante. Angalia kikasha chako na ubofye kiungo kwenye barua pepe yetu ili kuthibitisha.','Leave this empty'=>'Acha hii wazi','E-mail address'=>'Barua pepe','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya mtumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® Pro Membership: every Pro plugin, one licence'=>'Uanachama wa Zinn® Pro: kila programu-jalizi ya Pro, leseni moja','The Pro versions of Page Builder Sandwich, Tranzly, Zinn® SEO, Zinn® Cache and Zinn® Backups, and every Pro plugin we release next, from %s a year. A second membership adds Zinn® Chat Pro.'=>'Toleo za Pro za Page Builder Sandwich, Tranzly, Zinn® SEO, Zinn® Cache na Zinn® Backups, na kila programu-jalizi ya Pro tutakayotoa baadaye, kuanzia %s kwa mwaka. Uanachama wa pili unaongeza Zinn® Chat Pro.','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Uhostingi wa Zinn® kwa WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamishaji wa bila malipo na paneli dhibiti iliyoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha tovuti zaidi ya moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizothibitiwa, vikoa na upangaji wa viungo, huku pesa zikiwekwa salama hadi pande zote mbili ziridhike.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — waajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii ili kujipatia riziki','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari zaidi ya huduma 10,000 zilizotengenezwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, wasanidi programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwape nafasi ya kutoa zabuni.','Email me offers and reminders, including about items left in my cart. I can unsubscribe at any time.'=>'Nitumie ofa na vikumbusho kupitia barua pepe, ikiwa ni pamoja na kuhusu bidhaa zilizoachwa kwenye rukwama yangu. Ninaweza kujiondoa wakati wowote.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama maelezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Huduma ya usasishaji ya Zinn® haikutoa kiungo cha kupakua kwa usasishaji huu. Hakikisha tovuti hii inaweza kufikia jukwaa la Zinn®, kisha ujaribu tena.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Sasisho halikuweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwa huduma ya kusasisha ya Zinn® (%s). Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa kukaguliwa uadilifu wake na halijasakinishwa.']];